<title>HONG KONG: Amsteel unit launches US$50 mln FRN.</title>
<headline>Amsteel unit launches US$50 mln FRN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by arranger Peregrine Capital.</p>
<p> BORROWER   AMSTEEL CAPITAL INTERNATIONAL BV</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  AMSTEEL CAPITAL HOLDINGS BHD</p>
<p> AMT	US$50 MLN   COUPON    6ML+135    MATURITY    3 YRS</p>
<p> TYPE     FRN	   ISS PRICE PAR	  LAUNCHED    22.NOV.96</p>
<p> PUTS     NONE	  CALLS     NONE	 REPLIES     16.DEC.96</p>
<p> LISTING  NONE	  REPAYMENT BULLET     DENOMS	US$100K</p>
<p> RATINGS  NONE	  SALE LMTS STANDARD   PAY DATE   *14.JAN.96</p>
<p> NEG PLG  YES	   CRS DEF   YES	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA2</p>
<p> GOV LAW  ENGLISH     HOME CTRY MALAYSIA   TAX PROV    --</p>
<p>MGT LEVELS AND FEES  CO-LEADS  US$5 MLN+  15 BP ALL-IN 140</p>
<p>			    MANAGERS  US$2 MLN+  10 BP ALL-IN 138.33</p>
<p>ARRANGER  PEREGRINE CAPITAL AND OVERSEAS UNION BANK  NOTES     PARENT COMPANY SHAREHOLDING MUST NOT FALL BELOW</p>
<p>	     51 PCT. AMSTEEL CAPITAL HOLDINGS IS WHOLLY OWNED BY</p>
<p>	     AMSTEEL CORP.</p>
<p>	 -- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843-6371</p>
</text>
